<mxfile host="app.diagrams.net" modified="2026-08-27T12:00:00.000Z" agent="HiSEP-Q audit" version="24.7.17">
  <diagram id="quantum-flow" name="Quantum Instruction Flow">
    <mxGraphModel dx="1900" dy="1400" grid="1" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="1" pageScale="1" pageWidth="2200" pageHeight="1600" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <mxCell id="title" value="Quantum instruction and timed-dispatch flow" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=24;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="10" width="1200" height="30" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Canonical path: custom-0 opcode `0x0B`; funct3 selects SINGLE/PAIR/ROT.G/ROT.V.&#xa;This diagram separates the raw element stream from the fire-time AWG boundary." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=12;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="20" y="50" width="720" height="70" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="s0" value="1. Ibex offloads a custom-0 instruction through XIF&#xa;Fields: GateID/reserved [31:25], rs2-or-vs2, vs1, funct3, Block_imm&#xa;There is no `vd` or quantum mask operand." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="160" width="290" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s1" value="2. `vproc_top` forwards the XIF issue request to `vproc_core`." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="300" width="290" height="80" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s2" value="3. `vproc_decoder` matches opcode `0x0B`&#xa;funct3 000/001/010/011 selects ELEM_QSINGLE/QPAIR/QROTG/QROTV&#xa;Quantum custom-0 operations do not write `vd`." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="430" width="350" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s3" value="4. Decoder operand mapping&#xa;SINGLE: vs1 index + scalar rs2 payload&#xa;PAIR: vs1 control + vs2 target&#xa;ROT.G: vs1 index + scalar angle&#xa;ROT.V: vs1 e8 index + vs2 e32 angle" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="620" width="380" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s4" value="5. `vproc_queue` and `vproc_dispatcher` schedule the ELEM operation using normal vproc hazard and lane rules." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#ffe6cc;strokeColor=#d79b00;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="810" width="360" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s5" value="6. `vproc_pipeline_wrapper` and `vproc_vregunpack` produce active element operands using current VL/SEW/LMUL." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="520" y="160" width="390" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s6" value="7. Operand slices enter `vproc_elem`&#xa;Canonical custom-0 SINGLE/PAIR are unmasked.&#xa;ROT still has an undocumented bit-25 mask residue (known gap)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="520" y="360" width="430" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s7" value="8. `vproc_elem` exports one accepted raw quantum beat&#xa;op, instr_id, elem1, elem2, elem3, first/last sidebands" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="520" y="560" width="420" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s8" value="9. Raw-stream payload&#xa;SINGLE: elem1 index, elem2 scalar, elem3 GateID/offset&#xa;PAIR: elem1 control, elem2 target, elem3 GateID/offset&#xa;ROT.V keeps a 32-bit raw angle; ROT.G is currently truncated in e8." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fff2cc;strokeColor=#d6b656;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="520" y="740" width="470" height="190" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s9" value="10. `vproc_qdisp_top` connects accepted beats to `quantum_dispatcher` and supplies the global `t_cnt`." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#e1d5e7;strokeColor=#9673a6;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="220" width="420" height="130" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s10" value="11. Dispatcher accumulates one instruction by ID&#xa;On ID change or 8 idle cycles it validates and burst-writes all touched qubits with one timestamp." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#dae8fc;strokeColor=#6c8ebf;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="420" width="410" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="s11" value="12. Per-qubit timed FIFOs store `{time, role, GateID}`&#xa;At target time they pulse `qubit_valid_o` and output GateID/role.&#xa;No class tag or angle payload is stored yet." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=14;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="600" width="390" height="110" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="branch" value="Current fire-time command: timestamp + 7-bit GateID + role.&#xa;Bounds, duplicate endpoints/qubits, and equal-time conflicts are rejected.&#xa;Parameterized rotation needs a queued 32-bit payload before it can reach the AWG boundary." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=13;align=left;spacing=6;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1080" y="780" width="500" height="150" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="decision" value="Accepted beat and legal index?" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1040" y="980" width="170" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="yesbox" value="No&#xa;emit classified error&#xa;do not enqueue the invalid contribution" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#f8cecc;strokeColor=#b85450;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1290" y="980" width="180" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="nobox" value="Yes&#xa;accumulate contribution for atomic instruction commit" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="810" y="980" width="180" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="e1" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s0" target="s1"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e2" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s1" target="s2"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e3" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s2" target="s3"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e4" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s3" target="s4"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e5" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s4" target="s5"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e6" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s5" target="s6"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e7" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s6" target="s7"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e8" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s7" target="s8"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e9" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s8" target="s9"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e10" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s9" target="s10"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e11" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s10" target="s11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e12" value="validation" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="s8" target="decision"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e13" value="legal" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="decision" target="nobox"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
        <mxCell id="e14" value="invalid" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;" edge="1" parent="1" source="decision" target="yesbox"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>        <mxCell id="e16" value="commit path" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=0;jettySize=auto;html=1;endArrow=block;strokeWidth=2;dashed=1;" edge="1" parent="1" source="nobox" target="s11"><mxGeometry relative="1" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
